      ":question/id": "a81045d6-3892-5a00-9c3c-f89d12be53b0",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n6\\sin\\left(67.5^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(67.5^{\\circ}\\right)\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=67.5^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(135^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6\\sin\\left(67.5^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(67.5^{\\circ}\\right)&=3\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
