      ":question/id": "e028ee12-09c4-5cf4-abbd-e86b1689f8ee",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\sin\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}\\right)\n$$\n\n$$\n\\sin\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}\\right)=\n$$\n{{value}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{4}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sin\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{8}\\right)&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
