      ":question/id": "ad003933-1da3-50f3-a6f1-1af9b15ec325",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\left(\\sin\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)+\\cos\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)\\right)^2\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Expand the square and use the Pythagorean identity.\n\nSet $x=22.5^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\sin x+\\cos x)^2 &= \\sin^2 x+2\\sin x\\cos x+\\cos^2 x \\\\ &=1+2\\sin x\\cos x \\\\ &=1+\\sin(2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(45^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left(\\sin\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)+\\cos\\left(22.5^{\\circ}\\right)\\right)^2&=1+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + 1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
