      ":question/id": "101d5959-4f52-5e8b-b4b5-84c7224b6154",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)}{\\sec\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)}\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Rewrite the reciprocal denominator to expose a sine\u2013cosine product.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}$.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin\\left(x\\right)}{\\sec\\left(x\\right)}=\\sin\\left(x\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sec\\left(x\\right)}=\\sin x\\cos x\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)}{\\sec\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)}&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
